{"lyrics":"[00:05.48]Mm-mm, mm-mm-mm, mm\n[00:07.32]Just wanna let you know I love you, but\n[00:12.34]When you put me down so easily, I frown\n[00:19.66]Your words, they haunt my mind, but I'll lie and say I'm fine\n[00:27.02]When you put me down so easily, I frown but I need you in my life\n[00:38.12]Our souls are intertwined, uh, uh, uh\n[00:43.98]Baby, you know that you got a knife on your tongue, cut away at everything that I bask in\n[00:51.32]Downplay my thoughts and all of my opinions, so much for being repetitive\n[00:58.68]You say the perfect things, to make me feel like I'm not enough for you\n[01:04.46]It kinda sucks, 'cause I am in love with you, you make me feel so damn uncomfortable to tell you how I feel\n[01:13.60]But I want this for real, not a faker, kinda scared to tell you my problems, you seem abrasive\n[01:20.66]Runnin' 'way from all of the drama, I've been evasive, still thinkin' 'bout it on a daily basis","words":[[5.48,5.64,"Mm-mm,"],[5.68,5.94,"mm-mm-mm,"],[6.48,6.8,"mm"],[7.32,7.46,"Just"],[7.56,7.84,"wanna"],[8.02,8.42,"let"],[8.5,8.66,"you"],[8.76,9.36,"know"],[9.68,9.68,"I"],[9.82,10.34,"love"],[10.4,10.44,"you,"],[10.76,11.02,"but"],[12.34,12.58,"When"],[12.8,12.9,"you"],[13.94,14.1,"put"],[14.28,14.36,"me"],[14.64,15.8,"down"],[16.0,16.08,"so"],[16.56,17.64,"easily,"],[18.3,18.3,"I"],[18.72,19.26,"frown"],[19.66,19.92,"Your"],[20.12,20.72,"words,"],[20.8,20.98,"they"],[21.08,21.4,"haunt"],[21.5,21.8,"my"],[21.96,22.32,"mind,"],[23.12,23.3,"but"],[23.34,23.42,"I'll"],[23.78,24.38,"lie"],[24.48,24.58,"and"],[24.7,24.96,"say"],[25.0,25.14,"I'm"],[25.6,26.28,"fine"],[27.02,27.26,"When"],[27.46,27.58,"you"],[28.62,28.8,"put"],[28.98,29.04,"me"],[29.32,30.32,"down"],[30.64,30.74,"so"],[31.24,32.2,"easily,"],[32.98,32.98,"I"],[33.4,33.96,"frown"],[34.12,34.28,"but"],[34.62,34.62,"I"],[34.8,35.5,"need"],[35.54,35.7,"you"],[35.86,35.98,"in"],[36.18,36.46,"my"],[36.64,38.04,"life"],[38.12,38.26,"Our"],[38.42,39.12,"souls"],[39.22,39.52,"are"],